# netlist of sch_room.sch, from schnet
part C101 capacitor value 100N swap 1,2 name room.cn
part C102 capacitor value 100N swap 1,2 name room.cp
part FB101 ferrite value 742863160 swap 1,2 name room.fbn
part FB102 ferrite value 742863160 swap 1,2 name room.fbp
part R101 resistor value 1K swap 1,2 name room.rf
part R102 resistor value 1K swap 1,2 name room.rg
part U101 ti/lmh6609 value LMH6609 pins in+:3,in-:2,out:6,v+:7,v-:4 name room.amp
net +5V global class power FB102.2
net -5V global class power FB101.2
net GND global class power C101.2 C102.2 R102.2
net IN global U101.3
net OUT global R101.1 U101.6
net room.amp.in- R101.2 R102.1 U101.2
net room.amp.v+ C102.1 FB102.1 U101.7
net room.amp.v- C101.1 FB101.1 U101.4
